 "name": "Veil of the Faceless God",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/faceless-god.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Madness Inducement</em></p>\n<p>As a bonus action for 3 cursed energy, your face is adorned with a veil for 1 minute. A creature with at least 10% corruption that can see you must make an Intelligence saving throw at the beginning of their turn. On a failed save, they gain a -1 to all rolls for every 10% corruption they have until the start of their next turn (does not stack with <em>Theia Mania</em>). An affected creature repeats the save at the start of their turn, ending the effect on a success and automatically succeeds the save if it cannot see you.</p>",
